sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Cashier
  participant UI as Sales page
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant SF as Safaricom Daraja
  actor P as Customer phone
  C->>UI: Pick M-Pesa, enter customer number
  UI->>API: POST /api/payments/mpesa/stk-push
  API->>SF: STK Push request
  SF->>P: Payment prompt
  P->>SF: Customer enters PIN
  SF->>API: POST /api/payments/mpesa/callback
  loop every 3 seconds
    UI->>API: GET /api/payments/mpesa/status/id
    API-->>UI: pending or success
  end
  UI->>API: POST /api/sales (payment confirmed)
  UI-->>C: Sale completed with M-Pesa receipt
